-- ako/mxcli#1367: `list features` had no `mxcli syntax` topic, a three-part
-- version was a parse error, and `in <area>` failed for the areas that are
-- lexer keywords (workflows, microflows, pages, …). All of these parse now;
-- `mxcli syntax features` documents them, and each topic's "Requires" lines
-- come from the same registry (sdk/versions/*.yaml).
mdl 1;
list features for version 10.20.0;
list features for version 10.24;
list features added since 11.0.0;
